    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D side-scrolling platformer with cute and dreamlike aesthetics. The ever growing colossal tree known as &quot;the witch's hand&quot; is growing out of control. Froggo sets foot on a journey to the sky island that the tree originated from in hopes of finding a solution to save his home. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains 12 different linear levels to run around in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features a none-linear overworld map, so choose the ones you want to tackle first and let your adventure happen like a dream!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frog game </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D side-scrolling platformer with cute and dreamlike aesthetics. The ever growing colossal tree known as &quot;the witch's hand&quot; is growing out of control. Froggo sets foot on a journey to the sky island that the tree originated from in hopes of finding a solution to save his home. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains 12 different linear levels to run around in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features a none-linear overworld map, so choose the ones you want to tackle first and let your adventure happen like a dream!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frog game </p></li></ul>",
